    {
      "id": "claim_48daaf3737d04e3d93da1a4e634a8e12",
      "statement": "A node runs two HTTP listeners: the public Worker listener (auto ports 8080-8099) and the internal peer/operator listener defaulting to loopback ephemeral; the advertised address must reach the internal listener and celld cannot verify hostnames or translated ports.",
