    {
      "id": "claim_576bca0744ce43d1a706b45eeb68bd0f",
      "statement": "The unauthenticated public /do/ route refuses every reserved runtime class via the single is_reserved_scope predicate, because a reserved cell's fetch surface is an operator protocol (arbitrary SQL for D1, create/terminate/events for a workflow) addressed by config names rather than secrets.",
      "evidence": [
