    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ecda2243345e4b569db48f44e785066a",
      "statement": "Ingress takes one generation snapshot for GET/HEAD so an adoption racing a request cannot mix the new generation's asset index with the old generation's Worker, and static assets are answered before the Worker unless the path is worker-first.",
