      "statement": "Cell fetch and RPC traffic carries only a protocol version with no content signature and depends on the trusted private network, while peer-control and reserved-cell operator requests are HMAC-signed, and the first current node creates fleet/peer-auth.json, making bucket credentials equivalent to fleet administrator access.",
