      "statement": "Each accepted or proxied WebSocket becomes its own task in one of three shapes (local, proxied to the owner, outbound), and celld pins fastwebsockets =0.8.1 with the unstable-split feature because a WebSocket read is not cancel-safe: the live read half must survive while the same socket is written.",
